  <name>Multi2FA TOTP</name>
  <summary>Encrypted TOTP/HOTP two-factor authenticator</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Offline authenticator for two-factor codes. Accounts are kept in password protected vaults
      encrypted with Argon2id and XChaCha20-Poly1305 that never leave your device.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Add accounts from a camera, the screen, an image, the clipboard or by hand</li>
      <li>Imports otpauth links and Google Authenticator exports</li>
      <li>Several vaults at once, nested folders, drag and drop and instant search</li>
      <li>Auto-lock, clipboard clearing and encrypted backups</li>
      <li>Selectable key derivation and encryption, secrets stay encrypted in memory</li>
      <li>Color themes with dark and light variants, 6 languages</li>
      <li>Includes multi2fa-cli to read codes and manage vaults from a terminal</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
